    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21120" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρύτεα</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρύτια</span></b>  (so prob. in <i><span class="en">
			Cerc.
			4.34
		</span></i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ]</span>), τά, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
